{{Quote|Inflicts pain-based attacks, causing damage over time.|Shop}}
'''Pain''' (formerly known as '''Paw''') is a {{Legendary}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|2,300,000}} or {{Robux|2,200}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Pain allows the user to convert damage taken and absorbed Pain Ghosts into additional power. The fruit operates more off of the emotion itself rather than an element, with its attacks being mostly energy based, specializing in range. 

Upon losing all [[health]], the fruit automatically enters a '''Last Stand''', a second life that temporarily grants nearly every buff the game has to offer. It should be noted however, that in this state players '''will''' die if they do not defeat a player. This causes the fruit to give the user an immortality like perk.

